{%- comment -%}
  ============================================================================
  SNIPPET: Cart drawer ZZEN
  Ruta: snippets/cart-drawer.liquid   (SUSTITUYE al archivo actual)

  Se invoca desde sections/cart-drawer.liquid así:
      {%- render 'cart-drawer', s: section.settings, blocks: section.blocks -%}

  ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  LO QUE NO SE PUEDE TOCAR Y POR QUÉ

  Dawn refresca este drawer por dos caminos distintos, y cada uno reemplaza un
  trozo diferente del árbol:

    CartDrawer.getSectionsToRender()       -> #CartDrawer      (al AÑADIR)
    CartDrawerItems.getSectionsToRender()  -> .drawer__inner   (al CAMBIAR CANTIDAD)

  Por eso la barra de desbloqueos y las recomendaciones van DENTRO de
  .drawer__inner. Si estuvieran fuera se actualizarían al añadir un producto
  pero se quedarían congeladas al subir o bajar cantidades, y ese bug no se ve
  probando porque casi nadie prueba restando.

  Todos los ganchos que consume cart.js siguen intactos aunque las etiquetas
  hayan pasado de <table> a <div>: el contrato son los IDs y los atributos, no
  el HTML. Se conservan #CartDrawer-Item-N, #CartDrawer-LineItemError-N,
  #CartDrawer-CartItems.js-contents, #CartDrawer-CartErrors,
  #CartDrawer-LiveRegionText, #CartDrawer-LineItemStatus, el .loading__spinner
  por línea, quantity-input con su input name="updates[]" y data-index, y
  cart-remove-button con data-index dentro de cart-drawer-items.

  ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  DOS DECISIONES QUE PARECEN RAREZAS Y NO LO SON

  1. La clase is-empty va en <cart-drawer-items>, nunca en <cart-drawer>.
     Dawn la ponía en <cart-drawer> pero su renderContents la busca en
     .drawer__inner, que nunca la lleva: es una línea muerta. Resultado en el
     tema original: si el carrito estaba vacío y añadías desde fuera, seguían
     aplicando `cart-drawer.is-empty .drawer__inner { display:grid; padding:0 }`
     y `.drawer__header { display:none }`, así que el drawer se abría sin
     cabecera y con la maquetación del estado vacío. Dejándola solo en
     cart-drawer-items desaparece el problema y se mantiene lo único que
     interesaba de esa clase: ocultar el pie cuando no hay nada.

  2. Las líneas se pintan en el orden de Shopify y se invierten con CSS
     (column-reverse), no con `for ... reversed`. La referencia muestra lo
     último añadido arriba, pero invertir en Liquid desordena el name="updates[]"
     del formulario: si alguien pulsa Enter en una cantidad sin JavaScript, el
     POST a /cart aplica las cantidades a las líneas equivocadas. Con CSS el
     DOM conserva el orden real y el efecto visual es idéntico.
  ============================================================================
{%- endcomment -%}

{{ 'zzen-cart-drawer.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

<style>
  /* Estado cerrado. No borrar: .drawer.active es lo único que Dawn declara,
     y sin este oculto el velo del carrito tapa la página entera. */
  .drawer {
    visibility: hidden;
  }
</style>
<script src="{{ 'cart.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>
<script src="{{ 'quantity-popover.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>
<script src="{{ 'zzen-cart-drawer.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>

{%- liquid
  assign gift_prop = '_zzen_gift'

  # Marcadores de sustitución de los textos configurables.
  assign PH_AMOUNT = '{amount}'
  assign PH_REWARD = '{reward}'
  assign PH_TOTAL = '{total}'

  # La opacidad del velo se calcula aquí, no dentro del filtro de color:
  # Liquid encadena de izquierda a derecha y el divided_by acabaría
  # aplicándose al color en lugar de al número.
  assign overlay_alpha = s.overlay_opacity | divided_by: 100.0

  # Qué parte del círculo se apoya en el punto del hito.
  case s.milestone_anchor
    when 'right'
      assign mark_shift = '-100%'
    when 'left'
      assign mark_shift = '0%'
    else
      assign mark_shift = '-50%'
  endcase

  # --------------------------------------------------------------------------
  # Importe que cuenta para los hitos.
  # Los regalos se descuentan siempre. Si no, al desbloquear uno su precio
  # entraría en el cálculo y el carrito podría quedarse por encima del umbral
  # solo gracias al propio regalo: se añade, sube el total, ya no baja, y el
  # regalo nunca se retira. Con el descuento previo el número es estable.
  # --------------------------------------------------------------------------
  assign gift_sum = 0
  for item in cart.items
    if item.properties[gift_prop] != blank
      assign gift_sum = gift_sum | plus: item.final_line_price
    endif
  endfor

  if s.progress_basis == 'total'
    assign qualifying = cart.total_price | minus: gift_sum
  else
    assign qualifying = cart.items_subtotal_price | minus: gift_sum
  endif
  if qualifying < 0
    assign qualifying = 0
  endif

  # --------------------------------------------------------------------------
  # Cuántos hitos hay y cuál es el mayor (para el modo proporcional).
  # --------------------------------------------------------------------------
  assign ms_count = 0
  assign ms_max = 0
  for b in blocks
    if b.type == 'milestone' and b.settings.threshold > 0
      assign ms_count = ms_count | plus: 1
      assign t = b.settings.threshold | times: 100 | round
      if t > ms_max
        assign ms_max = t
      endif
    endif
  endfor

  # --------------------------------------------------------------------------
  # Relleno de la barra e hito pendiente.
  # La barra no avanza proporcional al importe total sino por tramos: dentro de
  # cada segmento entre dos círculos el avance es lineal. Así el visitante ve
  # que se acerca al siguiente premio, que es la única lectura que le importa.
  # --------------------------------------------------------------------------
  assign fill = 100
  assign all_done = true
  assign next_reward = ''
  assign next_remaining = 0
  assign prev_thr = 0
  assign prev_pos = 0
  assign idx = 0

  for b in blocks
    unless b.type == 'milestone'
      continue
    endunless
    assign t = b.settings.threshold | times: 100 | round
    if t <= 0
      continue
    endif
    assign idx = idx | plus: 1

    if s.progress_spacing == 'amount' and ms_max > 0
      assign pos = t | times: 100.0 | divided_by: ms_max
    else
      assign pos = idx | times: 100.0 | divided_by: ms_count
    endif

    if qualifying < t
      assign all_done = false
      assign next_reward = b.settings.reward | default: b.settings.label
      assign next_remaining = t | minus: qualifying

      assign span = t | minus: prev_thr
      assign into = qualifying | minus: prev_thr
      if into < 0
        assign into = 0
      endif
      if span > 0
        assign frac = into | times: 10000 | divided_by: span
      else
        assign frac = 10000
      endif
      assign pos_span = pos | minus: prev_pos
      assign step_add = pos_span | times: frac | divided_by: 10000.0
      assign fill = prev_pos | plus: step_add
      break
    endif

    assign prev_thr = t
    assign prev_pos = pos
  endfor

  assign fill = fill | round: 2
  if fill < 0
    assign fill = 0
  endif

  # --------------------------------------------------------------------------
  # Productos que ya están en el carrito, para no recomendarlos.
  # Se envuelve cada id en comas para que "contains" no acierte por trozos:
  # sin ellas, el id 12 daría positivo dentro de 123.
  # --------------------------------------------------------------------------
  assign cart_pids = ','
  for item in cart.items
    assign cart_pids = cart_pids | append: item.product_id | append: ','
  endfor
-%}

{%- comment -%}
  Reglas de regalo para el motor. Cada hito con producto asociado genera una:
  el umbral en céntimos, la variante a añadir y, si ya está en el carrito, la
  clave de su línea para poder retirarla.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture gift_rules -%}
[
{%- assign first_rule = true -%}
{%- for b in blocks -%}
  {%- if b.type == 'milestone' and b.settings.gift_product != blank -%}
    {%- assign gv = b.settings.gift_product.selected_or_first_available_variant -%}
    {%- if gv != blank -%}
      {%- unless first_rule -%},{%- endunless -%}
      {%- assign first_rule = false -%}
      {%- assign gkey = '' -%}
      {%- for item in cart.items -%}
        {%- if item.properties[gift_prop] == b.id -%}
          {%- assign gkey = item.key -%}
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
      {"id":{{ b.id | json }},"variant":{{ gv.id }},"threshold":{{ b.settings.threshold | times: 100 | round }},"key":{{ gkey | json }},"remove":{{ b.settings.gift_auto_remove | json }}}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
]
{%- endcapture -%}

{%- style -%}
  .zsd {
    --zsd-panel-w: {{ s.panel_width }}px;
    --zsd-panel-r: {{ s.panel_radius }}px;
    --zsd-panel-bg: {{ s.panel_bg }};
    --zsd-overlay: {{ s.overlay_color | color_modify: 'alpha', overlay_alpha }};
    --zsd-divider: {{ s.divider_color }};
    --zsd-pad-x: {{ s.pad_x }}px;

    --zsd-title-size: {{ s.title_size }}px;
    --zsd-title-color: {{ s.title_color }};
    --zsd-close-bg: {{ s.close_bg }};
    --zsd-close-color: {{ s.close_color }};
    --zsd-close-size: {{ s.close_size }}px;

    --zsd-prog-color: {{ s.progress_text_color }};
    --zsd-prog-size: {{ s.progress_text_size }}px;
    --zsd-track: {{ s.track_color }};
    --zsd-track-h: {{ s.track_height }}px;
    --zsd-fill: {{ s.fill_color }};
    --zsd-dot: {{ s.milestone_size }}px;
    --zsd-dot-bg: {{ s.milestone_bg }};
    --zsd-dot-border: {{ s.milestone_border }};
    --zsd-dot-icon: {{ s.milestone_icon }};
    --zsd-dot-bg-on: {{ s.milestone_bg_on }};
    --zsd-dot-icon-on: {{ s.milestone_icon_on }};
    --zsd-dot-label: {{ s.milestone_label_color }};
    --zsd-dot-label-size: {{ s.milestone_label_size }}px;
    --zsd-dot-label-w: {{ s.milestone_label_width }}px;
    --zsd-mark-shift: {{ mark_shift }};
    --zsd-prog-pad: {{ s.progress_side_pad }}px;

    --zsd-img: {{ s.line_img_size }}px;
    --zsd-img-r: {{ s.line_img_radius }}px;
    --zsd-img-bg: {{ s.line_img_bg }};
    --zsd-line-title: {{ s.line_title_color }};
    --zsd-line-title-size: {{ s.line_title_size }}px;
    --zsd-line-meta: {{ s.line_meta_color }};
    --zsd-line-price: {{ s.line_price_color }};
    --zsd-line-compare: {{ s.line_compare_color }};
    --zsd-line-saving: {{ s.line_saving_color }};
    --zsd-qty-border: {{ s.qty_border }};
    --zsd-qty-color: {{ s.qty_color }};
    --zsd-qty-h: {{ s.qty_height }}px;
    --zsd-qty-r: {{ s.qty_radius }}px;

    --zsd-reco-bg: {{ s.reco_card_bg }};
    --zsd-reco-r: {{ s.reco_card_radius }}px;
    --zsd-reco-img: {{ s.reco_img_size }}px;
    --zsd-reco-btn-bg: {{ s.reco_btn_bg }};
    --zsd-reco-btn-color: {{ s.reco_btn_color }};

    --zsd-footer-bg: {{ s.footer_bg }};
    --zsd-co-bg: {{ s.checkout_bg }};
    --zsd-co-color: {{ s.checkout_color }};
    --zsd-co-h: {{ s.checkout_height }}px;
    --zsd-co-r: {{ s.checkout_radius }}px;

    --zsd-empty-size: {{ s.empty_size }}px;
    --zsd-empty-color: {{ s.empty_color }};
    --zsd-empty-h: {{ s.empty_min_height }}px;
  }
  {%- if s.panel_full_mobile -%}
    @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
      .zsd .drawer__inner { width: 100vw; max-width: 100vw; }
    }
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endstyle -%}

<cart-drawer class="drawer zsd">
  <div id="CartDrawer" class="cart-drawer">
    <div id="CartDrawer-Overlay" class="cart-drawer__overlay"></div>

    <div
      class="drawer__inner zsd__panel"
      role="dialog"
      aria-modal="true"
      aria-label="{{ s.title | default: 'Cesta' | escape }}"
      tabindex="-1"
    >
      {%- comment -%} ---------------- Cabecera ---------------- {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="drawer__header zsd__header">
        <h2 class="drawer__heading zsd__title">{{ s.title }}</h2>
        <button
          class="drawer__close zsd__close"
          type="button"
          onclick="this.closest('cart-drawer').close()"
          aria-label="{{ 'accessibility.close' | t }}"
        >
          <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
            <path d="M5.5 5.5l9 9M14.5 5.5l-9 9" />
          </svg>
        </button>
      </div>


      {%- comment -%} ---------------- Zona con scroll ---------------- {%- endcomment -%}
      <cart-drawer-items
        class="zsd__body{% if cart.item_count == 0 %} is-empty{% endif %}"
        view-event-payload="{{ cart | standard_event_data: 'view', context: 'dialog' | escape }}"
        view-event-trigger="manual"
      >
        {%- comment -%}
          ---------------- Barra de desbloqueos + motor ----------------
          El elemento del motor se pinta SIEMPRE, incluso con la barra apagada:
          es lo que vuelve a arrancar la comprobación de regalos en cada
          re-render. Si solo existiera cuando la barra está visible, apagar la
          barra desactivaría los regalos sin que nadie entendiera por qué.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        <zzen-cart-engine
          class="zsd__engine"
          data-qualifying="{{ qualifying }}"
          data-gifts="{{ gift_rules | strip_newlines | escape }}"
          data-gift-prop="{{ gift_prop }}"
          data-cart-add-url="{{ routes.cart_add_url }}"
          data-cart-change-url="{{ routes.cart_change_url }}"
        >
          {%- if s.progress_enabled and ms_count > 0 -%}
            <div class="zsd-prog">
              <p class="zsd-prog__text">
                {%- if all_done -%}
                  {{ s.progress_done_text }}
                {%- else -%}
                  {%- liquid
                    assign amount_str = next_remaining | money
                    assign prog_line = s.progress_text | replace: PH_AMOUNT, amount_str | replace: PH_REWARD, next_reward
                  -%}
                  {{- prog_line -}}
                {%- endif -%}
              </p>

              <div class="zsd-prog__rail">
                <div class="zsd-prog__track">
                  <span
                    class="zsd-prog__fill"
                    data-zsd-fill
                    style="width: {{ fill }}%;"
                  ></span>
                </div>

                {%- assign m = 0 -%}
                {%- for b in blocks -%}
                  {%- unless b.type == 'milestone' -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endunless -%}
                  {%- assign t = b.settings.threshold | times: 100 | round -%}
                  {%- if t <= 0 -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
                  {%- assign m = m | plus: 1 -%}
                  {%- if s.progress_spacing == 'amount' and ms_max > 0 -%}
                    {%- assign pos = t | times: 100.0 | divided_by: ms_max -%}
                  {%- else -%}
                    {%- assign pos = m | times: 100.0 | divided_by: ms_count -%}
                  {%- endif -%}
                  {%- assign is_on = false -%}
                  {%- if qualifying >= t -%}{%- assign is_on = true -%}{%- endif -%}

                  <div
                    class="zsd-prog__mark{% if is_on %} is-on{% endif %}"
                    style="left: {{ pos | round: 2 }}%;"
                    {{ b.shopify_attributes }}
                  >
                    <span class="zsd-prog__dot" aria-hidden="true">
                      {%- if b.settings.icon_svg != blank -%}
                        {{ b.settings.icon_svg }}
                      {%- elsif b.settings.icon_image != blank -%}
                        <img src="{{ b.settings.icon_image | image_url: width: 80 }}" alt="" loading="lazy">
                      {%- else -%}
                        {%- case b.settings.icon -%}
                          {%- when 'discount' -%}
                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false">
                              <path d="M13.5 2.5H20a1.5 1.5 0 0 1 1.5 1.5v6.5L11 21 3 13l10.5-10.5z" />
                              <circle cx="17" cy="7" r="1.4" />
                            </svg>
                          {%- when 'gift' -%}
                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false">
                              <path d="M3 9h18v3H3zM4.5 12v8.5h15V12M12 9v11.5" />
                              <path d="M12 9S9.5 9 8.2 7.9C7 6.9 7.3 4.9 8.8 4.6c1.6-.3 3.2 2.3 3.2 4.4zM12 9s2.5 0 3.8-1.1c1.2-1 .9-3-.6-3.3-1.6-.3-3.2 2.3-3.2 4.4z" />
                            </svg>
                          {%- when 'star' -%}
                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false">
                              <path d="M12 3l2.7 5.7 6.3.8-4.6 4.3 1.2 6.2L12 17.1 6.4 20l1.2-6.2L3 9.5l6.3-.8z" />
                            </svg>
                          {%- else -%}
                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false">
                              <path d="M1.8 6h10.4v9.5H1.8zM12.2 9.5h4.9l3.1 3v3h-8z" />
                              <circle cx="6.2" cy="18" r="2" />
                              <circle cx="17" cy="18" r="2" />
                              <path d="M8.2 18h6.8" />
                            </svg>
                        {%- endcase -%}
                      {%- endif -%}
                    </span>
                    {%- if b.settings.label != blank -%}
                      <span class="zsd-prog__label">{{ b.settings.label }}</span>
                    {%- endif -%}
                  </div>
                {%- endfor -%}
              </div>
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}
        </zzen-cart-engine>

        <div class="zsd__scroll">
        <form
          action="{{ routes.cart_url }}"
          id="CartDrawer-Form"
          class="cart__contents cart-drawer__form zsd__form"
          method="post"
        >
          <div id="CartDrawer-CartItems" class="drawer__contents js-contents zsd__items">
            {%- unless cart.item_count == 0 -%}
              <div class="zsd__lines">
                {%- for item in cart.items -%}
                  {%- liquid
                    assign i = item.index | plus: 1

                    assign is_gift = false
                    if item.properties[gift_prop] != blank
                      assign is_gift = true
                    endif

                    # Base para el tachado y el ahorro. Cubre los dos casos que
                    # aparecen en la referencia: precio rebajado de la variante
                    # (compare_at) y descuento aplicado a la línea.
                    assign base = item.original_line_price
                    if item.variant.compare_at_price > item.variant.price
                      assign base = item.variant.compare_at_price | times: item.quantity
                    endif
                    assign saving = base | minus: item.final_line_price

                    assign lock_qty = false
                    if is_gift and s.gift_lock_qty
                      assign lock_qty = true
                    endif
                    if item.instructions and item.instructions.can_update_quantity == false
                      assign lock_qty = true
                    endif

                    assign hide_remove = false
                    if is_gift and s.gift_hide_remove
                      assign hide_remove = true
                    endif
                    if item.instructions and item.instructions.can_remove == false
                      assign hide_remove = true
                    endif

                    assign meta = ''
                    unless item.product.has_only_default_variant
                      assign meta = item.variant.title
                    endunless
                    if item.selling_plan_allocation != null
                      if meta != blank
                        assign meta = meta | append: ' - '
                      endif
                      assign meta = meta | append: item.selling_plan_allocation.selling_plan.name
                    endif

                    assign min_attr = 0
                    if item.variant.quantity_rule.min > 1
                      assign min_attr = item.variant.quantity_rule.min
                    endif

                    assign has_qty_rules = false
                    if item.variant.quantity_rule.increment > 1 or item.variant.quantity_rule.min > 1 or item.variant.quantity_rule.max != null
                      assign has_qty_rules = true
                    endif
                    assign has_vol_pricing = false
                    if item.variant.quantity_price_breaks.size > 0
                      assign has_vol_pricing = true
                    endif
                  -%}

                  <div
                    id="CartDrawer-Item-{{ i }}"
                    class="cart-item zsd-line{% if is_gift %} zsd-line--gift{% endif %}{% if item.parent_relationship.parent != null %} cart-item__nested-line zsd-line--nested{% endif %}"
                    {% if item.parent_relationship.parent != null %}
                      aria-label="{{- 'products.product.nested_label' | t: title: item.product.title, parent_title: item.parent_relationship.parent.title | escape -}}"
                    {% endif %}
                  >
                    <a class="zsd-line__media" href="{{ item.url }}" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
                      {%- if item.image -%}
                        <img
                          class="zsd-line__img cart-item__image"
                          src="{{ item.image | image_url: width: 200 }}"
                          alt="{{ item.image.alt | escape }}"
                          width="100"
                          height="{{ 100 | divided_by: item.image.aspect_ratio | ceil }}"
                          loading="lazy"
                          decoding="async"
                        >
                      {%- endif -%}
                    </a>

                    <div class="zsd-line__main">
                      <div class="zsd-line__top">
                        <div class="zsd-line__names">
                          <a href="{{ item.url }}" class="zsd-line__title cart-item__name">
                            {{- item.product.title | escape -}}
                          </a>
                          {%- if meta != blank -%}
                            <p class="zsd-line__meta">{{ meta }}</p>
                          {%- endif -%}
                          {%- for property in item.properties -%}
                            {%- assign pchar = property.first | slice: 0 -%}
                            {%- if property.last != blank and pchar != '_' -%}
                              <p class="zsd-line__meta">{{ property.first }}: {{ property.last }}</p>
                            {%- endif -%}
                          {%- endfor -%}
                        </div>

                        {%- unless hide_remove -%}
                          <cart-remove-button
                            id="CartDrawer-Remove-{{ i }}"
                            data-index="{{ i }}"
                            class="zsd-line__remove"
                          >
                            <button
                              type="button"
                              class="zsd-line__remove-btn"
                              aria-label="{{ 'sections.cart.remove_title' | t: title: item.title | escape }}"
                              data-variant-id="{{ item.variant.id }}"
                            >
                              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                                <path d="M4 7h16M9.5 7V4.5h5V7M6.5 7l1 13h9l1-13M10.5 10.5v6M13.5 10.5v6" />
                              </svg>
                            </button>
                          </cart-remove-button>
                        {%- endunless -%}
                      </div>

                      <div class="zsd-line__bottom">
                        {%- if lock_qty -%}
                          <span class="zsd-line__qty-static">{{ item.quantity }}&nbsp;u.</span>
                        {%- else -%}
                          <quantity-popover>
                            <div class="zsd-line__qty-wrap quantity-popover-wrapper">
                              <div class="quantity-popover-container{% if has_qty_rules or has_vol_pricing %} quantity-popover-container--hover{% endif %}">
                                <quantity-input class="zsd-qty quantity cart-quantity">
                                  <button class="zsd-qty__btn quantity__button" name="minus" type="button">
                                    <span class="visually-hidden">
                                      {{- 'products.product.quantity.decrease' | t: product: item.product.title | escape -}}
                                    </span>
                                    <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                                      <path d="M4.5 10h11" />
                                    </svg>
                                  </button>
                                  <input
                                    class="zsd-qty__input quantity__input"
                                    type="number"
                                    name="updates[]"
                                    value="{{ item.quantity }}"
                                    id="Drawer-quantity-{{ i }}"
                                    data-index="{{ i }}"
                                    data-quantity-variant-id="{{ item.variant.id }}"
                                    data-quantity-line-key="{{ item.key }}"
                                    {% # theme-check-disable %}
                                    data-cart-quantity="{{ cart | item_count_for_variant: item.variant.id }}"
                                    min="0"
                                    data-min="{{ min_attr }}"
                                    {% if item.variant.quantity_rule.max != null %}
                                      max="{{ item.variant.quantity_rule.max }}"
                                    {% endif %}
                                    step="{{ item.variant.quantity_rule.increment }}"
                                    {% # theme-check-enable %}
                                    aria-label="{{ 'products.product.quantity.input_label' | t: product: item.product.title | escape }}"
                                  >
                                  <button class="zsd-qty__btn zsd-qty__btn--plus quantity__button" name="plus" type="button">
                                  <span class="visually-hidden">
                                    {{- 'products.product.quantity.increase' | t: product: item.product.title | escape -}}
                                  </span>
                                  <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                                    <path d="M10 4.5v11M4.5 10h11" />
                                  </svg>
                                  {%- render 'loading-spinner' -%}
                                </button>
                                </quantity-input>
                              </div>
                            </div>

                            {%- if has_qty_rules or has_vol_pricing -%}
                              <button
                                type="button"
                                class="quantity-popover__info-button quantity-popover__info-button--icon-with-label button button--tertiary"
                                aria-expanded="false"
                              >
                                <span class="svg-wrapper">{{- 'icon-info.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}</span>
                                <span>
                                  {%- if has_vol_pricing -%}
                                    {{ 'products.product.volume_pricing.note' | t }}
                                  {%- else -%}
                                    {{ 'products.product.quantity.note' | t }}
                                  {%- endif -%}
                                </span>
                              </button>
                              <div class="cart-items__info global-settings-popup quantity-popover__info" tabindex="-1" hidden>
                                <div class="quantity__rules caption">
                                  {%- if item.variant.quantity_rule.increment > 1 -%}
                                    <span class="divider">
                                      {{- 'products.product.quantity.multiples_of' | t: quantity: item.variant.quantity_rule.increment -}}
                                    </span>
                                  {%- endif -%}
                                  {%- if item.variant.quantity_rule.min > 1 -%}
                                    <span class="divider">
                                      {{- 'products.product.quantity.min_of' | t: quantity: item.variant.quantity_rule.min -}}
                                    </span>
                                  {%- endif -%}
                                  {%- if item.variant.quantity_rule.max != null -%}
                                    <span class="divider">
                                      {{- 'products.product.quantity.max_of' | t: quantity: item.variant.quantity_rule.max -}}
                                    </span>
                                  {%- endif -%}
                                </div>
                                <button class="button-close button button--tertiary" type="button" aria-label="{{ 'accessibility.close' | t }}">
                                  <span class="svg-wrapper">{{- 'icon-close.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}</span>
                                </button>
                                {%- if has_vol_pricing -%}
                                  <volume-pricing class="parent-display">
                                    <ul class="list-unstyled">
                                      <li>
                                        <span>{{ item.variant.quantity_rule.min }}+</span>
                                        <span>{{ item.variant.price | money_with_currency }}/ea</span>
                                      </li>
                                      {%- for price_break in item.variant.quantity_price_breaks -%}
                                        <li>
                                          <span>{{ price_break.minimum_quantity }}<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></span>
                                          <span>{{ price_break.price | money_with_currency }}/ea</span>
                                        </li>
                                      {%- endfor -%}
                                    </ul>
                                  </volume-pricing>
                                {%- endif -%}
                              </div>
                            {%- endif -%}
                          </quantity-popover>
                        {%- endif -%}

                        <div class="zsd-line__prices">
                          {%- if lock_qty -%}
                            {%- render 'loading-spinner' -%}
                          {%- endif -%}
                          <div class="zsd-line__price-row">
                            {%- if saving > 0 -%}
                              <s class="zsd-line__compare cart-item__old-price">{{ base | money }}</s>
                            {%- endif -%}
                            <span class="zsd-line__price">{{ item.final_line_price | money }}</span>
                          </div>

                          {%- if s.line_show_saving and saving > 0 -%}
                            {%- liquid
                              assign sav_str = saving | money
                              assign sav_line = s.line_saving_text | replace: PH_AMOUNT, sav_str
                            -%}
                            <p class="zsd-line__saving">{{ sav_line }}</p>
                          {%- endif -%}

                          {%- if s.line_show_discount_chip -%}
                            {%- for discount in item.line_level_discount_allocations -%}
                              <span class="zsd-chip">
                                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                                  <path d="M13.5 2.5H20a1.5 1.5 0 0 1 1.5 1.5v6.5L11 21 3 13l10.5-10.5z" />
                                  <circle cx="17" cy="7" r="1.4" />
                                </svg>
                                {{ discount.discount_application.title }}
                              </span>
                            {%- endfor -%}
                          {%- endif -%}
                        </div>
                      </div>

                      <div id="CartDrawer-LineItemError-{{ i }}" class="cart-item__error zsd-line__error" role="alert">
                        <small class="cart-item__error-text"></small>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                {%- endfor -%}
              </div>
            {%- endunless -%}

            <p id="CartDrawer-LiveRegionText" class="visually-hidden" role="status"></p>
            <p id="CartDrawer-LineItemStatus" class="visually-hidden" aria-hidden="true" role="status">
              {{ 'accessibility.loading' | t }}
            </p>
          </div>

          <div id="CartDrawer-CartErrors" class="zsd__errors" role="alert"></div>
        </form>

        {%- if cart.item_count == 0 -%}
          <div class="zsd__empty">
            <p class="zsd__empty-text">
              {{- s.empty_text | default: 'Tu carrito está vacío' -}}
            </p>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- comment -%}
          ---------------- Recomendaciones ----------------
          El filtrado de lo que ya está en el carrito se hace en Liquid, no en
          JavaScript. Como el drawer se vuelve a renderizar en el servidor con
          cada cambio, un producto eliminado reaparece solo en la lista sin que
          nadie tenga que sincronizar nada.

          Se capturan primero las tarjetas para saber si queda alguna: si no,
          no se pinta ni el título y no queda un encabezado suelto.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- capture reco_cards -%}
          {%- assign shown = 0 -%}
          {%- for b in blocks -%}
            {%- unless b.type == 'reco' -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endunless -%}
            {%- assign pr = b.settings.product -%}
            {%- if pr == blank -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
            {%- if shown >= s.reco_max -%}{%- break -%}{%- endif -%}
            {%- unless pr.available -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endunless -%}
            {%- assign pid_key = ',' | append: pr.id | append: ',' -%}
            {%- if s.reco_exclude_in_cart and cart_pids contains pid_key -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
            {%- assign shown = shown | plus: 1 -%}
            {%- assign rv = pr.selected_or_first_available_variant -%}
            {%- assign as_link = false -%}
            {%- if pr.variants.size > 1 and s.reco_multi_variant == 'link' -%}
              {%- assign as_link = true -%}
            {%- endif -%}

            <div class="zsd-reco__card" {{ b.shopify_attributes }}>
              <a class="zsd-reco__media" href="{{ pr.url }}" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
                {%- if pr.featured_image -%}
                  <img
                    src="{{ pr.featured_image | image_url: width: 200 }}"
                    alt="{{ pr.featured_image.alt | escape }}"
                    width="100"
                    height="{{ 100 | divided_by: pr.featured_image.aspect_ratio | ceil }}"
                    loading="lazy"
                    decoding="async"
                  >
                {%- endif -%}
              </a>
              <div class="zsd-reco__body">
                <a class="zsd-reco__name" href="{{ pr.url }}">{{ pr.title }}</a>
                <p class="zsd-reco__price">{{ pr.price | money }}</p>
                {%- if as_link -%}
                  <a class="zsd-reco__btn" href="{{ pr.url }}">{{ s.reco_button }}</a>
                {%- else -%}
                  <button
                    type="button"
                    class="zsd-reco__btn"
                    data-zsd-add="{{ rv.id }}"
                    data-add-url="{{ routes.cart_add_url }}"
                  >
                    <span class="zsd-reco__btn-label">{{ s.reco_button }}</span>
                  </button>
                {%- endif -%}
              </div>
              <span class="zsd-reco__spinner" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            </div>
          {%- endfor -%}
        {%- endcapture -%}

        {%- assign reco_trim = reco_cards | strip -%}
        {%- if s.reco_enabled and reco_trim != blank -%}
          <div class="zsd-reco">
            {%- if s.reco_title != blank -%}
              <h3 class="zsd-reco__title">{{ s.reco_title }}</h3>
            {%- endif -%}
            <div class="zsd-reco__list">{{ reco_cards }}</div>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
        </div>
      </cart-drawer-items>

      {%- comment -%} ---------------- Pie ---------------- {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="drawer__footer cart-drawer__footer zsd__footer">
        {%- if s.show_note -%}
          <details id="Details-CartDrawer" class="zsd__note">
            <summary>
              <span class="summary__title">
                {{ 'sections.cart.note' | t }}
                {{- 'icon-caret.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
              </span>
            </summary>
            <cart-note class="cart__note field">
              <label class="visually-hidden" for="CartDrawer-Note">{{ 'sections.cart.note' | t }}</label>
              <textarea
                id="CartDrawer-Note"
                class="text-area text-area--resize-vertical field__input"
                name="note"
                placeholder="{{ 'sections.cart.note' | t }}"
              >{{ cart.note }}</textarea>
            </cart-note>
          </details>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if s.show_discounts_row and cart.cart_level_discount_applications.size > 0 -%}
          <div class="zsd__discounts">
            <span class="zsd__discounts-label">{{ s.discounts_label }}</span>
            <span class="zsd__discounts-chips">
              {%- for discount in cart.cart_level_discount_applications -%}
                <span class="zsd-chip">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                    <path d="M13.5 2.5H20a1.5 1.5 0 0 1 1.5 1.5v6.5L11 21 3 13l10.5-10.5z" />
                    <circle cx="17" cy="7" r="1.4" />
                  </svg>
                  {{ discount.title | escape }}
                </span>
              {%- endfor -%}
            </span>
            <span class="zsd__discounts-amount">
              -&nbsp;{{ cart.cart_level_discount_applications | map: 'total_allocated_amount' | sum | money }}
            </span>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if s.show_tax_note -%}
          <small class="zsd__tax rte">
            {%- if cart.taxes_included -%}
              {{ 'sections.cart.taxes_included_shipping_at_checkout_without_policy' | t }}
            {%- else -%}
              {{ 'sections.cart.taxes_at_checkout_shipping_at_checkout_without_policy' | t }}
            {%- endif -%}
          </small>
        {%- endif -%}

        <div class="cart__ctas zsd__ctas">
          {%- liquid
            assign total_str = cart.total_price | money
            assign co_label = s.checkout_label | replace: PH_TOTAL, total_str
          -%}
          <button
            type="submit"
            id="CartDrawer-Checkout"
            class="cart__checkout-button zsd__checkout"
            name="checkout"
            form="CartDrawer-Form"
            {% if cart.item_count == 0 %}
              disabled
            {% endif %}
          >
            {%- if s.checkout_lock_icon -%}
              <svg class="zsd__checkout-lock" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                <path d="M5.5 10.8h13v9.7h-13z" />
                <path d="M8.4 10.8V7.4a3.6 3.6 0 0 1 7.2 0v3.4" />
              </svg>
            {%- endif -%}
            <span>{{ co_label }}</span>
          </button>
        </div>

        {%- if s.show_payment_icons and shop.enabled_payment_types.size > 0 -%}
          <div class="zsd__pay" role="list" aria-label="{{ 'sections.footer.payment' | t }}">
            {%- for type in shop.enabled_payment_types -%}
              <span class="zsd__pay-icon" role="listitem">
                {{ type | payment_type_svg_tag: class: 'zsd__pay-svg' }}
              </span>
            {%- endfor -%}
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</cart-drawer>
